{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provider, and create it at launch."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" needs four things from your app: its configuration, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" for its keys, a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" for what it holds, and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" that attests it to issuers. The package has standard"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stores for the first two; the Wallet Provider is your backend."}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Add-the-package","type":"heading","text":"Add the package"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add OID4VCWallet to your app with Swift Package Manager, from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift"},{"type":"text","text":". In "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift\", from: \"0.9.0\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package links a binary framework, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":", which SwiftPM checks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against the checksum in the package’s manifest."}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Register-the-wallet","type":"heading","text":"Register the wallet"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Issuers’ Authorization Servers know the wallet as an OAuth client: a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client ID, and a redirect URI the app opens when the holder returns from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the issuer’s pages. Register a private-use URI scheme for it, in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app’s Info.plist ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CFBundleURLTypes"},{"type":"text","text":"), and pass the URL the app receives"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the issuance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet trusts only what chains to the roots you give it, as PEM"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"certificates: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" for credentials, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verifierRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Verifiers it answers. A Credential Offer’s issuer isn’t trusted just"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"because it sent the offer."}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Provide-the-keys-and-the-storage","type":"heading","text":"Provide the keys and the storage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps every key in the Secure Enclave. A holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key — the one a credential is bound to — signs only when presenting, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by default asks for Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode first: add an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" to the app’s Info.plist, or iOS asks for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode instead."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" keeps each credential as a file with complete","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data protection, out of backups: a credential is useless without its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder key, which can’t leave this device. An app with a document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider extension keeps both in places the extension can read too; see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Implement-the-Wallet-Provider","type":"heading","text":"Implement the Wallet Provider","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers following HAIP accept only a wallet its Wallet Provider has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attested: a Wallet Attestation for the wallet’s instance key, and a Key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Attestation for the keys a credential will be bound to. Your backend","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issues them; the app passes the keys and returns its answers. A real","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Wallet Provider attests only after checking App Attest evidence that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it’s talking to your genuine app.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Asks the app's backend for attestations. The keys are public JWKs,","\/\/\/ as JSON; the answers are compact JWTs.","struct BackendWalletProvider: WalletProvider {","    let backend: URL","","    func walletAttestation(clientID: String, instanceKey: Data) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"wallet-attestation\", [","            \"client_id\": clientID,","            \"instance_key\": try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: instanceKey),","        ])","    }","","    func keyAttestation(keys: [Data], nonce: String) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"key-attestation\", [","            \"keys\": try keys.map { try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: $0) },","            \"nonce\": nonce,","        ])","    }","","    private func post(_ path: String, _ body: [String: Any]) async throws -> String {","        var request = URLRequest(url: backend.appending(path: path))","        request.httpMethod = \"POST\"","        request.setValue(\"application\/json\", forHTTPHeaderField: \"Content-Type\")","        request.httpBody = try JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: body)","        let (data, response) = try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request)","        guard (response as? HTTPURLResponse)?.statusCode == 200 else { throw URLError(.badServerResponse) }","        return String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the provider throws reaches the wallet as a retryable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" error; any other is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Create-the-wallet","type":"heading","text":"Create the wallet","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Create one ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" when the app starts, and keep it. Creating it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes no network requests. At launch, before anything else, sweep the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Keychain of keys no credential uses: an issuance the app quit in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"middle of leaves its keys behind.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ The app's wallet, created once at launch.","@MainActor","final class AppWallet {","    let wallet: Wallet","    private let keys: KeychainKeyStore","","    init(clientID: String, redirectURI: String, issuerRoots: String, verifierRoots: String, provider: URL) throws {","        let configuration = WalletConfiguration(","            clientID: clientID,","            redirectURI: redirectURI,","            issuerRoots: issuerRoots,","            verifierRoots: verifierRoots)","        keys = KeychainKeyStore()","        wallet = try Wallet(","            configuration: configuration,","            keyStore: keys,","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.standard(),","            provider: BackendWalletProvider(backend: provider))","    }","","    \/\/\/ Run once at launch, before any issuance.","    func start() async throws {","        try await wallet.sweepOrphanedKeys(in: keys)","    }","}"]},{"anchor":"Ship-the-release-build","type":"heading","text":"Ship the release build","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links the release build of ","type":"text"},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". OID4VCgo’s own tests","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use a test build with an in-process issuer and Verifier that a shipped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app must never have; ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" says which one an app has,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so it can refuse to run on the test build.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Next-steps","type":"heading","text":"Next steps","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Getting started","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}]},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialStore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialstore","title":"CredentialStore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s credentials, as opaque records kept by ID under the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform’s data protection. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after "},{"code":"Options.tagPrefix","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"KeychainKeyStore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration","title":"WalletConfiguration","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"NewWallet’s configuration."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"title":"OID4VCWallet","role":"collection","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore","title":"FileCredentialStore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A credential store of files: one per credential record, in a directory"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the app’s (Application Support, by default). Records are written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the given file protection — complete by default: readable only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while the device is unlocked — and kept out of backups by default,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"since a credential is useless without its holder key, which is in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this device’s Secure Enclave and can’t be restored elsewhere."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","title":"Wallet","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential store and Wallet Provider."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ReceivingCredentials":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and look after them once they’re held."}],"title":"Receiving credentials","role":"article","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingFromALink":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingfromalink","title":"Presenting from a link","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"let the holder choose, and present exactly that."}],"type":"topic","role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/network":{"abstract":[{"text":"A request couldn’t be made, got no answer, or timed out. Retryable.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/network","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"network","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","text":"WalletError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","text":"Code","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","kind":"symbol","title":"network"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletProvider":{"abstract":[{"text":"The Wallet Provider’s backend, which attests the wallet and its keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(HAIP 1.0 §4.4.1, §4.5.1). Keys are public JWKs, as JSON; the results","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are compact JWTs. A real one attests only after checking platform","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"evidence (App Attest) that it’s talking to the genuine app.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletprovider","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"WalletProvider"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/GoingToProduction":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/goingtoproduction","title":"Going to production","abstract":[{"text":"What a wallet needs before real holders use it.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeyStore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keystore","title":"KeyStore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s keys: P-256 keys whose private halves never leave the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store (the Secure Enclave). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A thrown error reaches Go and comes back as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".platform"},{"type":"text","text":" WalletError."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyStore","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingInPerson":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Share an mdoc with a reader nearby over Bluetooth, or be the reader,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with ISO\/IEC 18013-5 device retrieval."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentinginperson","role":"article","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","kind":"article","title":"Presenting in person"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderAccessGroup":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/holderaccessgroup","title":"holderAccessGroup","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Keychain access group holder keys are made in, when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app shares them with an extension — a document provider"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting credentials, say — that lists the group in its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychain-access-groups"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement. Instance and DPoP keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stay in the app’s default group: only the app issues. nil:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every key is in the default group."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"holderAccessGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kin